{"symbol":"DESCO","yahoo":"DESCO.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Desco Infratech Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","website":"https://www.descoinfra.co.in","about":"Desco Infratech Limited operates as an infrastructure company in India. The company undertakes city gas distribution network project works, including piped natural gas; commercial and industrial natural gas connection; operation and maintenance of steel, medium-density polyethylene (MDPE), and GI network; MDPE pipeline laying; lock pressure test and leak detection test; manpower supply for protection of assets; and carbon steel pipeline laying and commissioning. It also engages power distribution projects comprising precise installation, erection, and commissioning of low- and high-tension cables for power distribution. In addition, the company is involved in water distribution projects and associated works, such as construction of open well, sump well, and overhead tanks; laying of HDPE and ductile iron pipelines; and construction of effluent water receiving chambers. Further, it provides foundational support for renewable energy projects, including the erection of RCC piles, erection of structure and solar modules, and commissioning of solar modules. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Surat, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:40:20+00:00","quote":{"price":178.0,"prevClose":179.3,"marketCap":136.63,"high52":293.65,"low52":122.0,"pe":8.36,"bookValue":92.22,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":25.2,"shares":0.7676,"insiders":96.07,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-17","2025-04-21","2025-04-22","2025-04-23","2025-04-24","2025-04-25","2025-04-28","2025-04-29","2025-04-30","2025-05-02","2025-05-05","2025-05-06","2025-05-07","2025-05-08","2025-05-09","2025-05-12","2025-05-13","2025-05-14","2025-05-15","20